{"componentChunkName":"component---src-templates-post-template-js","path":"/a-part-of-anti-virus-01-en","result":{"data":{"markdownRemark":{"id":"44233322-b3c1-5205-8b98-efaf32e07940","html":"<blockquote>\n<p>This page has been machine-translated from the <a href=\"/a-part-of-anti-virus-01\">original page</a>.- </p>\n</blockquote>\n<!-- omit in toc -->\n<h2 id=\"table-of-contents\" style=\"position:relative;\"><a href=\"#table-of-contents\" aria-label=\"table of contents permalink\" class=\"anchor before\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\" height=\"16\" version=\"1.1\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" width=\"16\"><path fill-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M4 9h1v1H4c-1.5 0-3-1.69-3-3.5S2.55 3 4 3h4c1.45 0 3 1.69 3 3.5 0 1.41-.91 2.72-2 3.25V8.59c.58-.45 1-1.27 1-2.09C10 5.22 8.98 4 8 4H4c-.98 0-2 1.22-2 2.5S3 9 4 9zm9-3h-1v1h1c1 0 2 1.22 2 2.5S13.98 12 13 12H9c-.98 0-2-1.22-2-2.5 0-.83.42-1.64 1-2.09V6.25c-1.09.53-2 1.84-2 3.25C6 11.31 7.55 13 9 13h4c1.45 0 3-1.69 3-3.5S14.5 6 13 6z\"></path></svg></a>Table of Contents</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"#setting-up-a-windows-server-2019-virtual-machine\">Setting Up a Windows Server 2019 Virtual Machine</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"#installing-visual-studio\">Installing Visual Studio</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"#downloading-and-building-driver-sample-code\">Downloading and Building Driver Sample Code</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"#installing-windbg\">Installing WinDbg</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"#chapter-summary\">Chapter Summary</a></li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"setting-up-a-windows-server-2019-virtual-machine\" style=\"position:relative;\"><a href=\"#setting-up-a-windows-server-2019-virtual-machine\" aria-label=\"setting up a windows server 2019 virtual machine permalink\" class=\"anchor before\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\" height=\"16\" version=\"1.1\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" width=\"16\"><path fill-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M4 9h1v1H4c-1.5 0-3-1.69-3-3.5S2.55 3 4 3h4c1.45 0 3 1.69 3 3.5 0 1.41-.91 2.72-2 3.25V8.59c.58-.45 1-1.27 1-2.09C10 5.22 8.98 4 8 4H4c-.98 0-2 1.22-2 2.5S3 9 4 9zm9-3h-1v1h1c1 0 2 1.22 2 2.5S13.98 12 13 12H9c-.98 0-2-1.22-2-2.5 0-.83.42-1.64 1-2.09V6.25c-1.09.53-2 1.84-2 3.25C6 11.31 7.55 13 9 13h4c1.45 0 3-1.69 3-3.5S14.5 6 13 6z\"></path></svg></a>Setting Up a Windows Server 2019 Virtual Machine</h2>\n<p>In this book, we use a Windows Server 2019 virtual machine to install and debug the built minifilter driver.</p>\n<p>The reason for choosing Windows Server 2019 as the debug OS is to uninstall Microsoft Defender Antivirus (MDAV), which is preinstalled.</p>\n<p>Unlike client OS versions such as Windows 10 and 11, server OS versions from Windows Server 2016 onward can easily disable or uninstall preinstalled Microsoft Defender Antivirus.</p>\n<p>Because uninstalling AntiVirus software introduces security risks, do this only on a virtual machine used for debugging.</p>\n<p>This book does not explain VM setup details, but you can use any virtualization software such as Hyper-V, VirtualBox, or VMware Workstation.</p>\n<p>For OS installation, use the evaluation image downloadable from the URL below.</p>\n<br>\n<p>URL: Microsoft Evaluation Center Windows Server 2019</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.microsoft.com/ja-jp/evalcenter/evaluate-windows-server-2019\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener noreferrer\">https://www.microsoft.com/ja-jp/evalcenter/evaluate-windows-server-2019</a></p>\n<br>\n<p>After opening the URL and filling in the required form, you can download evaluation Windows Server 2019 OS images as ISO or VHD.</p>\n<p>If you use a VHD file instead of ISO, you can start using the VM immediately without going through the OS installation process.</p>\n<p><span\n      class=\"gatsby-resp-image-wrapper\"\n      style=\"position: relative; display: block; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto; max-width: 960px; \"\n    >\n      <a\n    class=\"gatsby-resp-image-link\"\n    href=\"/static/d985aed34b2e90c912b1a22a3c54067c/61583/01-download-os-image.png\"\n    style=\"display: block\"\n    target=\"_blank\"\n    rel=\"noopener\"\n  >\n    <span\n    class=\"gatsby-resp-image-background-image\"\n    style=\"padding-bottom: 33.33333333333333%; position: relative; bottom: 0; left: 0; background-image: url('data:image/png;base64,'); background-size: cover; display: block;\"\n  ></span>\n  <picture>\n          <source\n              srcset=\"/static/d985aed34b2e90c912b1a22a3c54067c/8ac56/01-download-os-image.webp 240w,\n/static/d985aed34b2e90c912b1a22a3c54067c/d3be9/01-download-os-image.webp 480w,\n/static/d985aed34b2e90c912b1a22a3c54067c/e46b2/01-download-os-image.webp 960w,\n/static/d985aed34b2e90c912b1a22a3c54067c/f992d/01-download-os-image.webp 1440w,\n/static/d985aed34b2e90c912b1a22a3c54067c/1548f/01-download-os-image.webp 1616w\"\n              sizes=\"(max-width: 960px) 100vw, 960px\"\n              type=\"image/webp\"\n            />\n          <source\n            srcset=\"/static/d985aed34b2e90c912b1a22a3c54067c/8ff5a/01-download-os-image.png 240w,\n/static/d985aed34b2e90c912b1a22a3c54067c/e85cb/01-download-os-image.png 480w,\n/static/d985aed34b2e90c912b1a22a3c54067c/d9199/01-download-os-image.png 960w,\n/static/d985aed34b2e90c912b1a22a3c54067c/07a9c/01-download-os-image.png 1440w,\n/static/d985aed34b2e90c912b1a22a3c54067c/61583/01-download-os-image.png 1616w\"\n            sizes=\"(max-width: 960px) 100vw, 960px\"\n            type=\"image/png\"\n          />\n          <img\n            class=\"gatsby-resp-image-image\"\n            src=\"/static/d985aed34b2e90c912b1a22a3c54067c/d9199/01-download-os-image.png\"\n            alt=\"Evaluation OS image download screen\"\n            title=\"Evaluation OS image download screen\"\n            loading=\"lazy\"\n            style=\"width:100%;height:100%;margin:0;vertical-align:middle;position:absolute;top:0;left:0;\"\n          />\n        </picture>\n  </a>\n    </span></p>\n<p>After starting the configured Windows Server 2019 VM, uninstall Microsoft Defender Antivirus from Server Manager.</p>\n<p>Open [Remove Roles and Features], uncheck [Windows Defender AntiVirus], and complete the wizard.</p>\n<p><span\n      class=\"gatsby-resp-image-wrapper\"\n      style=\"position: relative; display: block; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto; max-width: 960px; \"\n    >\n      <a\n    class=\"gatsby-resp-image-link\"\n    href=\"/static/6b71a11cee886232acb717d3ca7893dd/1c3a5/01-Remove-Defender.png\"\n    style=\"display: block\"\n    target=\"_blank\"\n    rel=\"noopener\"\n  >\n    <span\n    class=\"gatsby-resp-image-background-image\"\n    style=\"padding-bottom: 71.25%; position: relative; bottom: 0; left: 0; background-image: url('data:image/png;base64,'); background-size: cover; display: block;\"\n  ></span>\n  <picture>\n          <source\n              srcset=\"/static/6b71a11cee886232acb717d3ca7893dd/8ac56/01-Remove-Defender.webp 240w,\n/static/6b71a11cee886232acb717d3ca7893dd/d3be9/01-Remove-Defender.webp 480w,\n/static/6b71a11cee886232acb717d3ca7893dd/e46b2/01-Remove-Defender.webp 960w,\n/static/6b71a11cee886232acb717d3ca7893dd/2b924/01-Remove-Defender.webp 981w\"\n              sizes=\"(max-width: 960px) 100vw, 960px\"\n              type=\"image/webp\"\n            />\n          <source\n            srcset=\"/static/6b71a11cee886232acb717d3ca7893dd/8ff5a/01-Remove-Defender.png 240w,\n/static/6b71a11cee886232acb717d3ca7893dd/e85cb/01-Remove-Defender.png 480w,\n/static/6b71a11cee886232acb717d3ca7893dd/d9199/01-Remove-Defender.png 960w,\n/static/6b71a11cee886232acb717d3ca7893dd/1c3a5/01-Remove-Defender.png 981w\"\n            sizes=\"(max-width: 960px) 100vw, 960px\"\n            type=\"image/png\"\n          />\n          <img\n            class=\"gatsby-resp-image-image\"\n            src=\"/static/6b71a11cee886232acb717d3ca7893dd/d9199/01-Remove-Defender.png\"\n            alt=\"Uninstall Microsoft Defender Antivirus from Server Manager\"\n            title=\"Uninstall Microsoft Defender Antivirus from Server Manager\"\n            loading=\"lazy\"\n            style=\"width:100%;height:100%;margin:0;vertical-align:middle;position:absolute;top:0;left:0;\"\n          />\n        </picture>\n  </a>\n    </span></p>\n<p>After uninstalling, run the <code class=\"language-text\">fltmc</code> command in Command Prompt and verify that the WdFilter minifilter driver is no longer loaded.</p>\n<p><span\n      class=\"gatsby-resp-image-wrapper\"\n      style=\"position: relative; display: block; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto; max-width: 602px; \"\n    >\n      <a\n    class=\"gatsby-resp-image-link\"\n    href=\"/static/0b402f86887f4f0cf56622a4d602bc9a/32056/01-remove-wdfilter.png\"\n    style=\"display: block\"\n    target=\"_blank\"\n    rel=\"noopener\"\n  >\n    <span\n    class=\"gatsby-resp-image-background-image\"\n    style=\"padding-bottom: 39.166666666666664%; position: relative; bottom: 0; left: 0; background-image: url('data:image/png;base64,'); background-size: cover; display: block;\"\n  ></span>\n  <picture>\n          <source\n              srcset=\"/static/0b402f86887f4f0cf56622a4d602bc9a/8ac56/01-remove-wdfilter.webp 240w,\n/static/0b402f86887f4f0cf56622a4d602bc9a/d3be9/01-remove-wdfilter.webp 480w,\n/static/0b402f86887f4f0cf56622a4d602bc9a/ff4b8/01-remove-wdfilter.webp 602w\"\n              sizes=\"(max-width: 602px) 100vw, 602px\"\n              type=\"image/webp\"\n            />\n          <source\n            srcset=\"/static/0b402f86887f4f0cf56622a4d602bc9a/8ff5a/01-remove-wdfilter.png 240w,\n/static/0b402f86887f4f0cf56622a4d602bc9a/e85cb/01-remove-wdfilter.png 480w,\n/static/0b402f86887f4f0cf56622a4d602bc9a/32056/01-remove-wdfilter.png 602w\"\n            sizes=\"(max-width: 602px) 100vw, 602px\"\n            type=\"image/png\"\n          />\n          <img\n            class=\"gatsby-resp-image-image\"\n            src=\"/static/0b402f86887f4f0cf56622a4d602bc9a/32056/01-remove-wdfilter.png\"\n            alt=\"Verify that WdFilter is not loaded\"\n            title=\"Verify that WdFilter is not loaded\"\n            loading=\"lazy\"\n            style=\"width:100%;height:100%;margin:0;vertical-align:middle;position:absolute;top:0;left:0;\"\n          />\n        </picture>\n  </a>\n    </span></p>\n<p>Next, install the redistributable package in the VM using the installer downloaded from the link below.</p>\n<p>This is required to run the Scanner sample module’s client program.</p>\n<br>\n<p>URL: Download latest supported Visual C++ Redistributable</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://learn.microsoft.com/ja-jp/cpp/windows/latest-supported-vc-redist?view=msvc-170\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener noreferrer\">https://learn.microsoft.com/ja-jp/cpp/windows/latest-supported-vc-redist?view=msvc-170</a></p>\n<br>\n<p>After uninstalling Microsoft Defender Antivirus and installing the redistributable package, run the following three commands in an elevated Command Prompt to enable test-signing mode and kernel debugging.</p>\n<div class=\"gatsby-highlight\" data-language=\"bash\"><pre class=\"language-bash\"><code class=\"language-bash\">bcdedit /set testsigning on\nbcdedit /debug on\nbcdedit /dbgsettings serial debugport:1 baudrate:115200</code></pre></div>\n<p>These commands enable installation of test-signed drivers<sup id=\"fnref-1\"><a href=\"#fn-1\" class=\"footnote-ref\">1</a></sup> and kernel debugging over COM port<sup id=\"fnref-2\"><a href=\"#fn-2\" class=\"footnote-ref\">2</a></sup> on the target VM.</p>\n<p>To install custom built kernel driver modules such as Scanner minifilter driver, you must enable test-signing mode as above.</p>\n<p>This is because, on Windows Vista and later, all drivers installed on the system require valid signatures.</p>\n<p>(Especially on Windows 10 version 1607 and later, drivers must have valid signatures granted by Microsoft.<sup id=\"fnref-3\"><a href=\"#fn-3\" class=\"footnote-ref\">3</a></sup> <sup id=\"fnref-4\"><a href=\"#fn-4\" class=\"footnote-ref\">4</a></sup>)</p>\n<p>However, if you enable test-signing mode on a debug Windows system with <code class=\"language-text\">bcdedit /set testsigning on</code>, you can install drivers signed with test self-signed certificates.</p>\n<p>So to install and run the kernel drivers used in this book, test-signing mode is required.</p>\n<p>When test-signing mode is enabled, drivers without Microsoft signatures can be installed, which increases the risk of malicious driver installation.</p>\n<p>For this reason, always enable test-signing mode only on debug virtual machines.</p>\n<h2 id=\"installing-visual-studio\" style=\"position:relative;\"><a href=\"#installing-visual-studio\" aria-label=\"installing visual studio permalink\" class=\"anchor before\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\" height=\"16\" version=\"1.1\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" width=\"16\"><path fill-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M4 9h1v1H4c-1.5 0-3-1.69-3-3.5S2.55 3 4 3h4c1.45 0 3 1.69 3 3.5 0 1.41-.91 2.72-2 3.25V8.59c.58-.45 1-1.27 1-2.09C10 5.22 8.98 4 8 4H4c-.98 0-2 1.22-2 2.5S3 9 4 9zm9-3h-1v1h1c1 0 2 1.22 2 2.5S13.98 12 13 12H9c-.98 0-2-1.22-2-2.5 0-.83.42-1.64 1-2.09V6.25c-1.09.53-2 1.84-2 3.25C6 11.31 7.55 13 9 13h4c1.45 0 3-1.69 3-3.5S14.5 6 13 6z\"></path></svg></a>Installing Visual Studio</h2>\n<p>Next, set up Visual Studio on a machine separate from the debug VM to build the minifilter driver.</p>\n<p>First, download and run the Visual Studio 2022 Community installer from the URL below.</p>\n<br>\n<p>URL: Visual Studio 2022 Downloads</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://visualstudio.microsoft.com/downloads/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener noreferrer\">https://visualstudio.microsoft.com/downloads/</a></p>\n<br>\n<p>After launching the installer, select any items including [Desktop development with C++].</p>\n<p><span\n      class=\"gatsby-resp-image-wrapper\"\n      style=\"position: relative; display: block; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto; max-width: 960px; \"\n    >\n      <a\n    class=\"gatsby-resp-image-link\"\n    href=\"/static/86726133bd36143f9c48219d7b93e089/a8c87/01-vs-install-01.png\"\n    style=\"display: block\"\n    target=\"_blank\"\n    rel=\"noopener\"\n  >\n    <span\n    class=\"gatsby-resp-image-background-image\"\n    style=\"padding-bottom: 50.83333333333333%; position: relative; bottom: 0; left: 0; background-image: url('data:image/png;base64,'); background-size: cover; display: block;\"\n  ></span>\n  <picture>\n          <source\n              srcset=\"/static/86726133bd36143f9c48219d7b93e089/8ac56/01-vs-install-01.webp 240w,\n/static/86726133bd36143f9c48219d7b93e089/d3be9/01-vs-install-01.webp 480w,\n/static/86726133bd36143f9c48219d7b93e089/e46b2/01-vs-install-01.webp 960w,\n/static/86726133bd36143f9c48219d7b93e089/f992d/01-vs-install-01.webp 1440w,\n/static/86726133bd36143f9c48219d7b93e089/5e0a5/01-vs-install-01.webp 1538w\"\n              sizes=\"(max-width: 960px) 100vw, 960px\"\n              type=\"image/webp\"\n            />\n          <source\n            srcset=\"/static/86726133bd36143f9c48219d7b93e089/8ff5a/01-vs-install-01.png 240w,\n/static/86726133bd36143f9c48219d7b93e089/e85cb/01-vs-install-01.png 480w,\n/static/86726133bd36143f9c48219d7b93e089/d9199/01-vs-install-01.png 960w,\n/static/86726133bd36143f9c48219d7b93e089/07a9c/01-vs-install-01.png 1440w,\n/static/86726133bd36143f9c48219d7b93e089/a8c87/01-vs-install-01.png 1538w\"\n            sizes=\"(max-width: 960px) 100vw, 960px\"\n            type=\"image/png\"\n          />\n          <img\n            class=\"gatsby-resp-image-image\"\n            src=\"/static/86726133bd36143f9c48219d7b93e089/d9199/01-vs-install-01.png\"\n            alt=\"Install components\"\n            title=\"Install components\"\n            loading=\"lazy\"\n            style=\"width:100%;height:100%;margin:0;vertical-align:middle;position:absolute;top:0;left:0;\"\n          />\n        </picture>\n  </a>\n    </span></p>\n<p>Then, on [Individual components], enter [64 latest] in the search box and select the required items.</p>\n<p><span\n      class=\"gatsby-resp-image-wrapper\"\n      style=\"position: relative; display: block; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto; max-width: 960px; \"\n    >\n      <a\n    class=\"gatsby-resp-image-link\"\n    href=\"/static/a84410bd31ce3a5cefc41913abe76cda/acd79/01-vs-install-02.png\"\n    style=\"display: block\"\n    target=\"_blank\"\n    rel=\"noopener\"\n  >\n    <span\n    class=\"gatsby-resp-image-background-image\"\n    style=\"padding-bottom: 50.83333333333333%; position: relative; bottom: 0; left: 0; background-image: url('data:image/png;base64,'); background-size: cover; display: block;\"\n  ></span>\n  <picture>\n          <source\n              srcset=\"/static/a84410bd31ce3a5cefc41913abe76cda/8ac56/01-vs-install-02.webp 240w,\n/static/a84410bd31ce3a5cefc41913abe76cda/d3be9/01-vs-install-02.webp 480w,\n/static/a84410bd31ce3a5cefc41913abe76cda/e46b2/01-vs-install-02.webp 960w,\n/static/a84410bd31ce3a5cefc41913abe76cda/f992d/01-vs-install-02.webp 1440w,\n/static/a84410bd31ce3a5cefc41913abe76cda/bb338/01-vs-install-02.webp 1543w\"\n              sizes=\"(max-width: 960px) 100vw, 960px\"\n              type=\"image/webp\"\n            />\n          <source\n            srcset=\"/static/a84410bd31ce3a5cefc41913abe76cda/8ff5a/01-vs-install-02.png 240w,\n/static/a84410bd31ce3a5cefc41913abe76cda/e85cb/01-vs-install-02.png 480w,\n/static/a84410bd31ce3a5cefc41913abe76cda/d9199/01-vs-install-02.png 960w,\n/static/a84410bd31ce3a5cefc41913abe76cda/07a9c/01-vs-install-02.png 1440w,\n/static/a84410bd31ce3a5cefc41913abe76cda/acd79/01-vs-install-02.png 1543w\"\n            sizes=\"(max-width: 960px) 100vw, 960px\"\n            type=\"image/png\"\n          />\n          <img\n            class=\"gatsby-resp-image-image\"\n            src=\"/static/a84410bd31ce3a5cefc41913abe76cda/d9199/01-vs-install-02.png\"\n            alt=\"Install individual components\"\n            title=\"Install individual components\"\n            loading=\"lazy\"\n            style=\"width:100%;height:100%;margin:0;vertical-align:middle;position:absolute;top:0;left:0;\"\n          />\n        </picture>\n  </a>\n    </span></p>\n<p>Also select [Windows Driver Kit] under [Individual components].</p>\n<p>In this guide, SDK is installed later with a separate installer, so uncheck SDK items here.</p>\n<p><span\n      class=\"gatsby-resp-image-wrapper\"\n      style=\"position: relative; display: block; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto; max-width: 960px; \"\n    >\n      <a\n    class=\"gatsby-resp-image-link\"\n    href=\"/static/be08acfac6fd3c086d8ebfcb972190f2/2b608/01-vs-install-03.png\"\n    style=\"display: block\"\n    target=\"_blank\"\n    rel=\"noopener\"\n  >\n    <span\n    class=\"gatsby-resp-image-background-image\"\n    style=\"padding-bottom: 50%; position: relative; bottom: 0; left: 0; background-image: url('data:image/png;base64,'); background-size: cover; display: block;\"\n  ></span>\n  <picture>\n          <source\n              srcset=\"/static/be08acfac6fd3c086d8ebfcb972190f2/8ac56/01-vs-install-03.webp 240w,\n/static/be08acfac6fd3c086d8ebfcb972190f2/d3be9/01-vs-install-03.webp 480w,\n/static/be08acfac6fd3c086d8ebfcb972190f2/e46b2/01-vs-install-03.webp 960w,\n/static/be08acfac6fd3c086d8ebfcb972190f2/f992d/01-vs-install-03.webp 1440w,\n/static/be08acfac6fd3c086d8ebfcb972190f2/96506/01-vs-install-03.webp 1540w\"\n              sizes=\"(max-width: 960px) 100vw, 960px\"\n              type=\"image/webp\"\n            />\n          <source\n            srcset=\"/static/be08acfac6fd3c086d8ebfcb972190f2/8ff5a/01-vs-install-03.png 240w,\n/static/be08acfac6fd3c086d8ebfcb972190f2/e85cb/01-vs-install-03.png 480w,\n/static/be08acfac6fd3c086d8ebfcb972190f2/d9199/01-vs-install-03.png 960w,\n/static/be08acfac6fd3c086d8ebfcb972190f2/07a9c/01-vs-install-03.png 1440w,\n/static/be08acfac6fd3c086d8ebfcb972190f2/2b608/01-vs-install-03.png 1540w\"\n            sizes=\"(max-width: 960px) 100vw, 960px\"\n            type=\"image/png\"\n          />\n          <img\n            class=\"gatsby-resp-image-image\"\n            src=\"/static/be08acfac6fd3c086d8ebfcb972190f2/d9199/01-vs-install-03.png\"\n            alt=\"Install individual components\"\n            title=\"Install individual components\"\n            loading=\"lazy\"\n            style=\"width:100%;height:100%;margin:0;vertical-align:middle;position:absolute;top:0;left:0;\"\n          />\n        </picture>\n  </a>\n    </span></p>\n<p>At this point, add optional tools such as [Windows for Git] as needed.</p>\n<p>After installing Visual Studio, download the latest SDK and WDK installers from [Step 2: Install SDK] and [Step 3: Install WDK] at the URL below.</p>\n<p>In this book, version 10.0.26100.1 was the latest at writing time.</p>\n<br>\n<p>URL: Download SDK and WDK</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://learn.microsoft.com/ja-jp/windows-hardware/drivers/download-the-wdk\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener noreferrer\">https://learn.microsoft.com/ja-jp/windows-hardware/drivers/download-the-wdk</a></p>\n<br>\n<p>After downloading installers, install SDK first, then WDK.</p>\n<p>Keep default installation paths for both.</p>\n<p>For SDK installation options, install all default items.</p>\n<p><span\n      class=\"gatsby-resp-image-wrapper\"\n      style=\"position: relative; display: block; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto; max-width: 917px; \"\n    >\n      <a\n    class=\"gatsby-resp-image-link\"\n    href=\"/static/1b43aba04fe0e674e6a158abb74cd5b9/59000/01-vs-install-07.png\"\n    style=\"display: block\"\n    target=\"_blank\"\n    rel=\"noopener\"\n  >\n    <span\n    class=\"gatsby-resp-image-background-image\"\n    style=\"padding-bottom: 73.75%; position: relative; bottom: 0; left: 0; background-image: url('data:image/png;base64,'); background-size: cover; display: block;\"\n  ></span>\n  <picture>\n          <source\n              srcset=\"/static/1b43aba04fe0e674e6a158abb74cd5b9/8ac56/01-vs-install-07.webp 240w,\n/static/1b43aba04fe0e674e6a158abb74cd5b9/d3be9/01-vs-install-07.webp 480w,\n/static/1b43aba04fe0e674e6a158abb74cd5b9/f91b9/01-vs-install-07.webp 917w\"\n              sizes=\"(max-width: 917px) 100vw, 917px\"\n              type=\"image/webp\"\n            />\n          <source\n            srcset=\"/static/1b43aba04fe0e674e6a158abb74cd5b9/8ff5a/01-vs-install-07.png 240w,\n/static/1b43aba04fe0e674e6a158abb74cd5b9/e85cb/01-vs-install-07.png 480w,\n/static/1b43aba04fe0e674e6a158abb74cd5b9/59000/01-vs-install-07.png 917w\"\n            sizes=\"(max-width: 917px) 100vw, 917px\"\n            type=\"image/png\"\n          />\n          <img\n            class=\"gatsby-resp-image-image\"\n            src=\"/static/1b43aba04fe0e674e6a158abb74cd5b9/59000/01-vs-install-07.png\"\n            alt=\"Install SDK\"\n            title=\"Install SDK\"\n            loading=\"lazy\"\n            style=\"width:100%;height:100%;margin:0;vertical-align:middle;position:absolute;top:0;left:0;\"\n          />\n        </picture>\n  </a>\n    </span></p>\n<p>After SDK installation finishes, install WDK.</p>\n<p>At the time of writing, with latest Visual Studio 2022, it seems fine to leave the Visual Studio extension checkbox unchecked at the end of WDK installation.</p>\n<p><span\n      class=\"gatsby-resp-image-wrapper\"\n      style=\"position: relative; display: block; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto; max-width: 908px; \"\n    >\n      <a\n    class=\"gatsby-resp-image-link\"\n    href=\"/static/812e1b168b69d5444b4400384696d340/a2b88/01-vs-install-08.png\"\n    style=\"display: block\"\n    target=\"_blank\"\n    rel=\"noopener\"\n  >\n    <span\n    class=\"gatsby-resp-image-background-image\"\n    style=\"padding-bottom: 73.75%; position: relative; bottom: 0; left: 0; background-image: url('data:image/png;base64,'); background-size: cover; display: block;\"\n  ></span>\n  <picture>\n          <source\n              srcset=\"/static/812e1b168b69d5444b4400384696d340/8ac56/01-vs-install-08.webp 240w,\n/static/812e1b168b69d5444b4400384696d340/d3be9/01-vs-install-08.webp 480w,\n/static/812e1b168b69d5444b4400384696d340/1f8a9/01-vs-install-08.webp 908w\"\n              sizes=\"(max-width: 908px) 100vw, 908px\"\n              type=\"image/webp\"\n            />\n          <source\n            srcset=\"/static/812e1b168b69d5444b4400384696d340/8ff5a/01-vs-install-08.png 240w,\n/static/812e1b168b69d5444b4400384696d340/e85cb/01-vs-install-08.png 480w,\n/static/812e1b168b69d5444b4400384696d340/a2b88/01-vs-install-08.png 908w\"\n            sizes=\"(max-width: 908px) 100vw, 908px\"\n            type=\"image/png\"\n          />\n          <img\n            class=\"gatsby-resp-image-image\"\n            src=\"/static/812e1b168b69d5444b4400384696d340/a2b88/01-vs-install-08.png\"\n            alt=\"Install WDK\"\n            title=\"Install WDK\"\n            loading=\"lazy\"\n            style=\"width:100%;height:100%;margin:0;vertical-align:middle;position:absolute;top:0;left:0;\"\n          />\n        </picture>\n  </a>\n    </span></p>\n<p>After all installation is complete, verify that [Empty WDM Driver] is selectable in [Create a new project] in Visual Studio.</p>\n<p><span\n      class=\"gatsby-resp-image-wrapper\"\n      style=\"position: relative; display: block; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto; max-width: 960px; \"\n    >\n      <a\n    class=\"gatsby-resp-image-link\"\n    href=\"/static/2042234264478dd7d4280be1ed46e7d6/e9140/01-vs-install-04.png\"\n    style=\"display: block\"\n    target=\"_blank\"\n    rel=\"noopener\"\n  >\n    <span\n    class=\"gatsby-resp-image-background-image\"\n    style=\"padding-bottom: 58.333333333333336%; position: relative; bottom: 0; left: 0; background-image: url('data:image/png;base64,'); background-size: cover; display: block;\"\n  ></span>\n  <picture>\n          <source\n              srcset=\"/static/2042234264478dd7d4280be1ed46e7d6/8ac56/01-vs-install-04.webp 240w,\n/static/2042234264478dd7d4280be1ed46e7d6/d3be9/01-vs-install-04.webp 480w,\n/static/2042234264478dd7d4280be1ed46e7d6/e46b2/01-vs-install-04.webp 960w,\n/static/2042234264478dd7d4280be1ed46e7d6/ab43a/01-vs-install-04.webp 1226w\"\n              sizes=\"(max-width: 960px) 100vw, 960px\"\n              type=\"image/webp\"\n            />\n          <source\n            srcset=\"/static/2042234264478dd7d4280be1ed46e7d6/8ff5a/01-vs-install-04.png 240w,\n/static/2042234264478dd7d4280be1ed46e7d6/e85cb/01-vs-install-04.png 480w,\n/static/2042234264478dd7d4280be1ed46e7d6/d9199/01-vs-install-04.png 960w,\n/static/2042234264478dd7d4280be1ed46e7d6/e9140/01-vs-install-04.png 1226w\"\n            sizes=\"(max-width: 960px) 100vw, 960px\"\n            type=\"image/png\"\n          />\n          <img\n            class=\"gatsby-resp-image-image\"\n            src=\"/static/2042234264478dd7d4280be1ed46e7d6/d9199/01-vs-install-04.png\"\n            alt=\"WDM Driver template\"\n            title=\"WDM Driver template\"\n            loading=\"lazy\"\n            style=\"width:100%;height:100%;margin:0;vertical-align:middle;position:absolute;top:0;left:0;\"\n          />\n        </picture>\n  </a>\n    </span></p>\n<h2 id=\"downloading-and-building-driver-sample-code\" style=\"position:relative;\"><a href=\"#downloading-and-building-driver-sample-code\" aria-label=\"downloading and building driver sample code permalink\" class=\"anchor before\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\" height=\"16\" version=\"1.1\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" width=\"16\"><path fill-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M4 9h1v1H4c-1.5 0-3-1.69-3-3.5S2.55 3 4 3h4c1.45 0 3 1.69 3 3.5 0 1.41-.91 2.72-2 3.25V8.59c.58-.45 1-1.27 1-2.09C10 5.22 8.98 4 8 4H4c-.98 0-2 1.22-2 2.5S3 9 4 9zm9-3h-1v1h1c1 0 2 1.22 2 2.5S13.98 12 13 12H9c-.98 0-2-1.22-2-2.5 0-.83.42-1.64 1-2.09V6.25c-1.09.53-2 1.84-2 3.25C6 11.31 7.55 13 9 13h4c1.45 0 3-1.69 3-3.5S14.5 6 13 6z\"></path></svg></a>Downloading and Building Driver Sample Code</h2>\n<p>After Visual Studio installation, download the driver sample source code from the repository below.</p>\n<br>\n<p>URL: Windows-driver-samples</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://github.com/Microsoft/Windows-driver-samples\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener noreferrer\">https://github.com/Microsoft/Windows-driver-samples</a></p>\n<br>\n<p>Extract the downloaded files and open <code class=\"language-text\">&lt;ExtractedFolder>\\filesys\\miniFilter\\scanner\\scanner.sln</code> in Visual Studio.</p>\n<p><span\n      class=\"gatsby-resp-image-wrapper\"\n      style=\"position: relative; display: block; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto; max-width: 960px; \"\n    >\n      <a\n    class=\"gatsby-resp-image-link\"\n    href=\"/static/87b1e9c58d1d06f2559a5ee2fe078ea2/393aa/01-vs-install-05.png\"\n    style=\"display: block\"\n    target=\"_blank\"\n    rel=\"noopener\"\n  >\n    <span\n    class=\"gatsby-resp-image-background-image\"\n    style=\"padding-bottom: 46.666666666666664%; position: relative; bottom: 0; left: 0; background-image: url('data:image/png;base64,'); background-size: cover; display: block;\"\n  ></span>\n  <picture>\n          <source\n              srcset=\"/static/87b1e9c58d1d06f2559a5ee2fe078ea2/8ac56/01-vs-install-05.webp 240w,\n/static/87b1e9c58d1d06f2559a5ee2fe078ea2/d3be9/01-vs-install-05.webp 480w,\n/static/87b1e9c58d1d06f2559a5ee2fe078ea2/e46b2/01-vs-install-05.webp 960w,\n/static/87b1e9c58d1d06f2559a5ee2fe078ea2/b6585/01-vs-install-05.webp 1190w\"\n              sizes=\"(max-width: 960px) 100vw, 960px\"\n              type=\"image/webp\"\n            />\n          <source\n            srcset=\"/static/87b1e9c58d1d06f2559a5ee2fe078ea2/8ff5a/01-vs-install-05.png 240w,\n/static/87b1e9c58d1d06f2559a5ee2fe078ea2/e85cb/01-vs-install-05.png 480w,\n/static/87b1e9c58d1d06f2559a5ee2fe078ea2/d9199/01-vs-install-05.png 960w,\n/static/87b1e9c58d1d06f2559a5ee2fe078ea2/393aa/01-vs-install-05.png 1190w\"\n            sizes=\"(max-width: 960px) 100vw, 960px\"\n            type=\"image/png\"\n          />\n          <img\n            class=\"gatsby-resp-image-image\"\n            src=\"/static/87b1e9c58d1d06f2559a5ee2fe078ea2/d9199/01-vs-install-05.png\"\n            alt=\"Open Scanner sample solution file\"\n            title=\"Open Scanner sample solution file\"\n            loading=\"lazy\"\n            style=\"width:100%;height:100%;margin:0;vertical-align:middle;position:absolute;top:0;left:0;\"\n          />\n        </picture>\n  </a>\n    </span></p>\n<p>When you open the solution in Solution Explorer, you can confirm there are two projects: Filter and User.</p>\n<p>First, right-click each project, open [Properties], and set Windows SDK version to the installed version.</p>\n<p><span\n      class=\"gatsby-resp-image-wrapper\"\n      style=\"position: relative; display: block; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto; max-width: 960px; \"\n    >\n      <a\n    class=\"gatsby-resp-image-link\"\n    href=\"/static/1d0e01603dfc5f919470a8f504252b96/6edca/01-vs-install-06.png\"\n    style=\"display: block\"\n    target=\"_blank\"\n    rel=\"noopener\"\n  >\n    <span\n    class=\"gatsby-resp-image-background-image\"\n    style=\"padding-bottom: 52.916666666666664%; position: relative; bottom: 0; left: 0; background-image: url('data:image/png;base64,'); background-size: cover; display: block;\"\n  ></span>\n  <picture>\n          <source\n              srcset=\"/static/1d0e01603dfc5f919470a8f504252b96/8ac56/01-vs-install-06.webp 240w,\n/static/1d0e01603dfc5f919470a8f504252b96/d3be9/01-vs-install-06.webp 480w,\n/static/1d0e01603dfc5f919470a8f504252b96/e46b2/01-vs-install-06.webp 960w,\n/static/1d0e01603dfc5f919470a8f504252b96/2d20a/01-vs-install-06.webp 1351w\"\n              sizes=\"(max-width: 960px) 100vw, 960px\"\n              type=\"image/webp\"\n            />\n          <source\n            srcset=\"/static/1d0e01603dfc5f919470a8f504252b96/8ff5a/01-vs-install-06.png 240w,\n/static/1d0e01603dfc5f919470a8f504252b96/e85cb/01-vs-install-06.png 480w,\n/static/1d0e01603dfc5f919470a8f504252b96/d9199/01-vs-install-06.png 960w,\n/static/1d0e01603dfc5f919470a8f504252b96/6edca/01-vs-install-06.png 1351w\"\n            sizes=\"(max-width: 960px) 100vw, 960px\"\n            type=\"image/png\"\n          />\n          <img\n            class=\"gatsby-resp-image-image\"\n            src=\"/static/1d0e01603dfc5f919470a8f504252b96/d9199/01-vs-install-06.png\"\n            alt=\"Project properties\"\n            title=\"Project properties\"\n            loading=\"lazy\"\n            style=\"width:100%;height:100%;margin:0;vertical-align:middle;position:absolute;top:0;left:0;\"\n          />\n        </picture>\n  </a>\n    </span></p>\n<p>In this book, because debug dependencies are not installed on the VM, set build [Configuration] to [Release] when building Scanner.</p>\n<p>Also verify [Platform] matches your environment (x64 in this book).</p>\n<p>If Visual Studio setup and SDK/WDK installation are complete, building the solution should successfully build both Scanner kernel driver and user-mode program.</p>\n<h2 id=\"installing-windbg\" style=\"position:relative;\"><a href=\"#installing-windbg\" aria-label=\"installing windbg permalink\" class=\"anchor before\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\" height=\"16\" version=\"1.1\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" width=\"16\"><path fill-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M4 9h1v1H4c-1.5 0-3-1.69-3-3.5S2.55 3 4 3h4c1.45 0 3 1.69 3 3.5 0 1.41-.91 2.72-2 3.25V8.59c.58-.45 1-1.27 1-2.09C10 5.22 8.98 4 8 4H4c-.98 0-2 1.22-2 2.5S3 9 4 9zm9-3h-1v1h1c1 0 2 1.22 2 2.5S13.98 12 13 12H9c-.98 0-2-1.22-2-2.5 0-.83.42-1.64 1-2.09V6.25c-1.09.53-2 1.84-2 3.25C6 11.31 7.55 13 9 13h4c1.45 0 3-1.69 3-3.5S14.5 6 13 6z\"></path></svg></a>Installing WinDbg</h2>\n<p>Install the latest WinDbg for program analysis.</p>\n<p>In this book, we use the latest WinDbg app, not WinDbg Classic included in Debug Tools for Windows SDK.</p>\n<p>Since this book performs kernel debugging, install WinDbg on the host machine that manages the virtual machine.</p>\n<p>If WinGet package manager is available, run the following in Command Prompt or PowerShell.</p>\n<div class=\"gatsby-highlight\" data-language=\"powershell\"><pre class=\"language-powershell\"><code class=\"language-powershell\">winget install Microsoft<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>WinDbg</code></pre></div>\n<p>If WinGet is unavailable, download WinDbg installer from the URL below and install manually.</p>\n<br>\n<p>Install Windows Debugger:</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://learn.microsoft.com/ja-jp/windows-hardware/drivers/debugger/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener noreferrer\">https://learn.microsoft.com/ja-jp/windows-hardware/drivers/debugger/</a></p>\n<br>\n<p>After installing WinDbg, update symbol server settings as follows.</p>\n<p>Getting correct symbols is very important for debugging with WinDbg.</p>\n<p>Symbols<sup id=\"fnref-5\"><a href=\"#fn-5\" class=\"footnote-ref\">5</a></sup> are information such as function and variable names not included in executable files like exe or dll.</p>\n<p>By obtaining and referencing proper symbols in tools like WinDbg, analysis becomes much smoother.</p>\n<p>Symbol information used in general debugging can be downloaded from Microsoft’s symbol server.<sup id=\"fnref-6\"><a href=\"#fn-6\" class=\"footnote-ref\">6</a></sup></p>\n<p>However, symbol information for some non-public modules or third-party software cannot be downloaded from Microsoft symbol servers.</p>\n<p>To configure symbol server, run WinDbg as administrator and open [File] > [Settings] > [Debugging Settings].</p>\n<p>In [Default Symbol Path], enter the following and click [OK].</p>\n<div class=\"gatsby-highlight\" data-language=\"powershell\"><pre class=\"language-powershell\"><code class=\"language-powershell\">srv*https:<span class=\"token operator\">/</span><span class=\"token operator\">/</span>msdl<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>microsoft<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>com/download/symbols</code></pre></div>\n<p>This updates WinDbg symbol server settings.</p>\n<p>If you want to reference symbol files for your own programs, add the local folder path to symbol path and reload modules with <code class=\"language-text\">.reload</code>.</p>\n<p>This book does not explain in detail how to prepare kernel debugging environment for VM with installed WinDbg.</p>\n<p>For kernel debugging environment setup, official documentation has rich information.<sup id=\"fnref-7\"><a href=\"#fn-7\" class=\"footnote-ref\">7</a></sup></p>\n<p>Magical WinDbg 2<sup id=\"fnref-8\"><a href=\"#fn-8\" class=\"footnote-ref\">8</a></sup>, distributed for free at Tech Book Fest 16, also explains kernel debugging environment setup in detail.</p>\n<h2 id=\"chapter-summary\" style=\"position:relative;\"><a href=\"#chapter-summary\" aria-label=\"chapter summary permalink\" class=\"anchor before\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\" height=\"16\" version=\"1.1\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" width=\"16\"><path fill-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M4 9h1v1H4c-1.5 0-3-1.69-3-3.5S2.55 3 4 3h4c1.45 0 3 1.69 3 3.5 0 1.41-.91 2.72-2 3.25V8.59c.58-.45 1-1.27 1-2.09C10 5.22 8.98 4 8 4H4c-.98 0-2 1.22-2 2.5S3 9 4 9zm9-3h-1v1h1c1 0 2 1.22 2 2.5S13.98 12 13 12H9c-.98 0-2-1.22-2-2.5 0-.83.42-1.64 1-2.09V6.25c-1.09.53-2 1.84-2 3.25C6 11.31 7.55 13 9 13h4c1.45 0 3-1.69 3-3.5S14.5 6 13 6z\"></path></svg></a>Chapter Summary</h2>\n<p>This chapter introduced how to prepare an environment to build Scanner sample drivers and debug the generated modules.</p>\n<p>Chapter 2 introduces an overview of Windows file system minifilter drivers.</p>\n<!-- omit in toc -->\n<h2 id=\"table-of-contents-1\" style=\"position:relative;\"><a href=\"#table-of-contents-1\" aria-label=\"table of contents 1 permalink\" class=\"anchor before\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\" height=\"16\" version=\"1.1\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" width=\"16\"><path fill-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M4 9h1v1H4c-1.5 0-3-1.69-3-3.5S2.55 3 4 3h4c1.45 0 3 1.69 3 3.5 0 1.41-.91 2.72-2 3.25V8.59c.58-.45 1-1.27 1-2.09C10 5.22 8.98 4 8 4H4c-.98 0-2 1.22-2 2.5S3 9 4 9zm9-3h-1v1h1c1 0 2 1.22 2 2.5S13.98 12 13 12H9c-.98 0-2-1.22-2-2.5 0-.83.42-1.64 1-2.09V6.25c-1.09.53-2 1.84-2 3.25C6 11.31 7.55 13 9 13h4c1.45 0 3-1.69 3-3.5S14.5 6 13 6z\"></path></svg></a>Table of Contents</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"/a-part-of-anti-virus-00-en\">Preface</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/a-part-of-anti-virus-01-en\">Chapter 1: Setup Environment Used in This Book</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/a-part-of-anti-virus-02-en\">Chapter 2: Introduction to File System Minifilter Drivers</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/a-part-of-anti-virus-03-en\">Chapter 3: Reading the Scanner Sample Code</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/a-part-of-anti-virus-04-en\">Chapter 4: Kernel Debugging Scanner with WinDbg</a></li>\n</ul>\n<div class=\"footnotes\">\n<hr>\n<ol>\n<li id=\"fn-1\">\n<p>Enable loading test-signed drivers <a href=\"https://learn.microsoft.com/ja-jp/windows-hardware/drivers/install/the-testsigning-boot-configuration-option\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener noreferrer\">https://learn.microsoft.com/ja-jp/windows-hardware/drivers/install/the-testsigning-boot-configuration-option</a></p>\n<a href=\"#fnref-1\" class=\"footnote-backref\">↩</a>\n</li>\n<li id=\"fn-2\">\n<p>Manually set up kernel-mode debugging for a VM using virtual COM port <a href=\"https://learn.microsoft.com/ja-jp/windows-hardware/drivers/debugger/attaching-to-a-virtual-machine--kernel-mode-\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener noreferrer\">https://learn.microsoft.com/ja-jp/windows-hardware/drivers/debugger/attaching-to-a-virtual-machine—kernel-mode-</a></p>\n<a href=\"#fnref-2\" class=\"footnote-backref\">↩</a>\n</li>\n<li id=\"fn-3\">\n<p>Driver signing <a href=\"https://learn.microsoft.com/ja-jp/windows-hardware/drivers/develop/signing-a-driver\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener noreferrer\">https://learn.microsoft.com/ja-jp/windows-hardware/drivers/develop/signing-a-driver</a></p>\n<a href=\"#fnref-3\" class=\"footnote-backref\">↩</a>\n</li>\n<li id=\"fn-4\">\n<p>Driver signing policy <a href=\"https://learn.microsoft.com/ja-jp/windows-hardware/drivers/install/kernel-mode-code-signing-policy--windows-vista-and-later-\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener noreferrer\">https://learn.microsoft.com/ja-jp/windows-hardware/drivers/install/kernel-mode-code-signing-policy—windows-vista-and-later-</a></p>\n<a href=\"#fnref-4\" class=\"footnote-backref\">↩</a>\n</li>\n<li id=\"fn-5\">\n<p>Symbols and symbol files <a href=\"https://learn.microsoft.com/ja-jp/windows-hardware/drivers/debugger/symbols-and-symbol-files\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener noreferrer\">https://learn.microsoft.com/ja-jp/windows-hardware/drivers/debugger/symbols-and-symbol-files</a></p>\n<a href=\"#fnref-5\" class=\"footnote-backref\">↩</a>\n</li>\n<li id=\"fn-6\">\n<p>Using a symbol server <a href=\"https://learn.microsoft.com/ja-jp/windows-hardware/drivers/debugger/using-a-symbol-server\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener noreferrer\">https://learn.microsoft.com/ja-jp/windows-hardware/drivers/debugger/using-a-symbol-server</a></p>\n<a href=\"#fnref-6\" class=\"footnote-backref\">↩</a>\n</li>\n<li id=\"fn-7\">\n<p>Manually set up kernel-mode debugging for a VM using virtual COM port <a href=\"https://learn.microsoft.com/ja-jp/windows-hardware/drivers/debugger/attaching-to-a-virtual-machine--kernel-mode-\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener noreferrer\">https://learn.microsoft.com/ja-jp/windows-hardware/drivers/debugger/attaching-to-a-virtual-machine—kernel-mode-</a></p>\n<a href=\"#fnref-7\" class=\"footnote-backref\">↩</a>\n</li>\n<li id=\"fn-8\">\n<p>Magical WinDbg 2 - Learn User Mode &#x26; Kernel Debugging in CTF -: <a href=\"https://techbookfest.org/product/6hBEkTPSxJC5vSRTqa81F9\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener noreferrer\">https://techbookfest.org/product/6hBEkTPSxJC5vSRTqa81F9</a></p>\n<a href=\"#fnref-8\" class=\"footnote-backref\">↩</a>\n</li>\n</ol>\n</div>","fields":{"slug":"/a-part-of-anti-virus-01-en","tagSlugs":["/tag/a-part-of-anti-virus-en/","/tag/windows-en/","/tag/win-dbg-en/","/tag/anti-virus-en/","/tag/english/"]},"frontmatter":{"date":"2024-12-07","description":"Web edition of A PART OF ANTI-VIRUS distributed at Tech Book Fest 17.","tags":["A PART OF ANTI-VIRUS (en)","Windows (en)","WinDbg (en)","AntiVirus (en)","English"],"title":"A PART OF ANTI-VIRUS [Chapter 1: Setup Environment Used in This Book]","socialImage":{"publicURL":"/static/7d251e0cb0100477cec66aa95c9e67a8/a-part-of-anti-virus.png"}}}},"pageContext":{"slug":"/a-part-of-anti-virus-01-en"}},"staticQueryHashes":["251939775","401334301","825871152"]}